         so any remaining owner-spike code stays compiled and tested under "dotnet test ... -c Release"
         even though the shipping mod's own -c Release build excludes it. OC-150 deleted the Release 1
         Arthur field-contact spike and its tests (archived at tag archive/oc-owner-spikes-release1-arthur). -->
    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);OC_OWNER_SPIKES</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

